摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A prompt-enhancement plugin for DeepSeek Harness: an ✨ Enhance composer button that rewrites prompts with first-principles thinking using session context, and asks clarifying questions when key info is missing.","id":"gh:1349320616","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-prompt-enhancer","slug":"yaoshuo530/dsh-prompt-enhancer","topics":["ai-agents","ai-assistant","cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","first-principles","javascript","llm","nodejs","open-source","plugin","prompt-engineering","prompt-enhancer","prompt-optimization","react"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A prompt-enhancement plugin for DeepSeek Harness: an ✨ Enhance composer button that rewrites prompts"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" with first-principles thinking using session context, and asks clarifying questions when key info i"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"t-principles thinking using session context, and asks clarifying questions when key info is missing."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-prompt-enhancer"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A prompt-enhancement plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH): an **\"✨ Enhance\"** button in the composer th"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"at rewrites your draft prompt into a more detailed, clearer, and structured version using **first-pr"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"inciples thinking** — grounded in your session context, memory, and recent conversation. When key in"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"formation is missing, it asks you through a clarification card before generating."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **One-click enhance**: an \"✨ Enhance\" button on the right end of the composer tool row\n- **First-p"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"rinciples methodology**: Think (return to the essence) → Plan (break down the structure) → Execute ("},{"id":"p6s3","text":"organize the expression) → Review (check coherence)\n- **Context-aware**: automatically reads the cur"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"rent session's agent system prompt (persona, memory, skill injections) and the recent conversation h"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"istory\n- **Clarification card**: when the model judges key information is missing, it pops up a card"},{"id":"p6s6","text":" (option buttons + free-text input + cancel) and continues after you answer\n- **Preview then apply**"},{"id":"p6s7","text":": the enhanced prompt is shown for review first; clicking \"Apply to input\" writes it into the compos"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"er — it is never sent automatically\n- **DSH-native look & feel**: blue button with white text, reusi"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"ng DSH's send-button theme tokens (`--dsw-alias-button-info-fill`)"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### Method 1: Host profile plugin (recommended — survives refresh and restart)"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"1. Clone or copy this repository to any local path, e.g. `~/dsh-plugins/dsh-prompt-enhancer`\n2. Edit"},{"id":"p9s2","text":" the DSH web profile (`~/.dsh/profiles/web/`):\n- Append to `package.json` → `dependencies`:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- Append to `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"3. Run `pnpm install` in `~/.dsh/profiles/web/`\n4. Restart `dsh web`, then refresh the page — the bu"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"tton appears in the composer tool row"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Method 2: Agent preset plugin"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Add the plugin row to your agent preset's composition (`~/.dsh/.agent-presets/<id>/agent.cordis.yml`"},{"id":"p15s2","text":") and mount the package in that preset. Note: loading the browser UI via the host profile (Method 1)"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" is the most stable."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"None required. The plugin automatically uses:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- **Model route**: the current session agent's model (`agent.options`), falling back to the `agent-d"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"efault-model` selection; it calls the model with thinking disabled (`reasoningEffort: off`) for spee"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"d and stability\n- **Context**: `systemPrompt.assemble()` (persona / memory / skills) + `sessionQuery"},{"id":"p18s4","text":".readSurface()` (last 30 messages)"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"1. Type a draft prompt in the composer, e.g. `Write a weekly summary report`\n2. Click the **\"✨ Enhan"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ce\"** button\n3. If the model decides key information is missing, a **clarification card** appears (e"},{"id":"p20s3","text":".g. \"What did you complete this week?\", \"Who is the audience?\") — select or type your answers, then "},{"id":"p20s4","text":"click \"Generate\"\n4. Preview the enhanced prompt, click **\"Apply to input\"** to write it into the com"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"poser, then edit and send as you like"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The output language follows your input language."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Example"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Input:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Enhanced output:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Dependencies"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness (DSH) web, with at least one working model route (e.g. DeepSeek official API)\n- N"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ode.js `^22.19.0 || >=24`\n- Browser-side packages (bundled with DSH web): `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-r"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"untime`, `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection`, `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots`, `@deepseek-ai/dsh"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"seek-ai/dsh-client-connection`, `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots`, `@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale`"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## How It Works"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Component | Description |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Host half (`lib/index.js`) | Serves `POST /__dsh-enhance/api` JSON RPC: `prepare` (decides whether"},{"id":"p31s2","text":" clarification is needed and returns a structured question JSON), `complete` (generates the final en"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"hanced prompt as plain text); assembles context and calls `llm.stream` |\n| Client half (`lib/client."},{"id":"p31s4","text":"js`) | ModuleLoader browser plugin: the composer button (`conversation.input.right`) and the overlay"},{"id":"p31s5","text":" cards (`shell.overlay` — busy / clarify / preview / error states) |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
